#ASSERT `What is the most imprisonment in years this court can give me` `a District Court` EQUALS JUST 10
#ASSERT `What is the most imprisonment in years this court can give me` `the General Division of the High Court` EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `What is the most fine this court can give me` `a Magistrate's Court` EQUALS JUST 10000

#ASSERT `What is the most strokes of the cane this court can give me` `a Magistrate's Court` EQUALS JUST 6

