§ `ss 65(4), 67, 68 -- how long I can be held`

#ASSERT `What is the most hours I can be held before being brought before a Magistrate's Court` FALSE 2 FALSE EQUALS JUST 50
#ASSERT `What is the most hours I can be held before being brought before a Magistrate's Court` TRUE 1 FALSE EQUALS JUST 25
#ASSERT `What is the most hours I can be held before being brought before a Magistrate's Court` FALSE 2 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `Is my detention without a warrant still within the limit` 49 2 TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Is my detention without a warrant still within the limit` 51 2 TRUE

-- The duty as a regulative rule: brought before a Magistrate at hour 30 (kept) and at hour 51 (broken), with 2 hours'
-- journey. Traces print FULFILLED and BREACH; they are not counted as assertions.
#TRACE `the police must bring me before a Magistrate within 48 hours` 2 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the police officer holding me` DOES `bring me before a Magistrate's Court` AT 30

#TRACE `the police must bring me before a Magistrate within 48 hours` 2 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the police officer holding me` DOES `bring me before a Magistrate's Court` AT 51

§ `ss 92, 93, 95 -- bail`

#ASSERT `What is my position on bail` `a bailable charge where the court fears I will abscond` EQUALS `the court may refuse to release me`
#ASSERT `What is my position on bail` `a fine-only charge where the court fears I will abscond` EQUALS `I must be released on bail or personal bond`
#ASSERT `What is my position on bail` `a non-bailable charge` EQUALS `I may be released on bail by a sergeant or above, or by the court`
#ASSERT `What is my position on bail` `a non-bailable charge with no reasonable grounds against me` EQUALS `I must be released on bail or personal bond`
#ASSERT `What is my position on bail` `a non-bailable charge where the court fears I will abscond` EQUALS `I must not be released on bail or personal bond`
#ASSERT `What is my position on bail` `a capital charge with an alternative punishment in a District Court` EQUALS `only the court may release me on bail`
#ASSERT `What is my position on bail` `an extradition arrest` EQUALS `I must not be released on bail or personal bond`

