§ `ss 232, 241, 242 -- discharge and compounding`

#ASSERT `What is the most the Public Prosecutor can collect to compound my offence` TRUE 20000 EQUALS JUST 5000
#ASSERT `What is the most the Public Prosecutor can collect to compound my offence` FALSE 4000 EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT NOT `Can the person named in the Fourth Schedule compound my offence without the Public Prosecutor's consent` TRUE TRUE

